{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentSpan","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"type","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Span","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component type.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"type"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Receives the span; its result is returned."}]}],"name":"body"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The span covers every component of the type in storage order, which is not the creation order once components were","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"removed. It is zero copy: it views the storage itself. Because ","type":"text"},{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"~Escapable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", it cannot leave ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(storing it in a variable outside the closure or returning it is a compile time error), so it can never dangle.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["var maxX = 0","nexus.componentSpan(reading: Position.self) { (positions: Span<Position>) in","    for i in positions.indices { maxX = max(maxX, positions[i].x) }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": loop over ","type":"text"},{"code":"indices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Element access is bounds checked.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" runs the type is locked for reading: structural changes (creating or destroying entities, adding or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removing components, replacing a component with "},{"code":"set","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and writes to the type stop the process with a message,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since they would move or change what the span views. Reading the component through the nexus and reading"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the type again are fine. Collect changes and apply them after the call."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An empty storage (or a type no entity ever had) passes an empty span.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Storage","anchor":"Storage","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sparse-set storage keeps all components of a type in one array, so the span always views the storage itself."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The archetype storage keeps one column per table (one table per component set), so entities with different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component sets are not next to each other. If one table holds all components of the type the span views its column,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as above. If several tables hold them, the span views a temporary copy that is made table by table, which costs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one allocation and O(N) copying per call and is released after "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEachComponentSpan(reading:_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to get zero copy spans, one batch per table."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1) plus "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"26.0","beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable